---
// Quiz figure for Post 3 set 05: ATC cumulative demand/supply table.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq03at">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 235" role="img" aria-label="ATC auction book at 14:44: at 25,100 VND cumulative buy is 3,200 and sell is 4,000 (3,200 matched); at 25,000 VND cumulative buy is 5,500 and sell is 3,800 (3,800 matched); at 24,900 VND cumulative buy is 6,200 and sell is 2,100 (2,100 matched).">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>HOSE ATC auction book at 14:44:30</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Sổ lệnh phiên ATC trên HOSE lúc 14:44:30</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="42" width="548" height="36" rx="6" class="qfig-thbg" />
    <text x="86" y="65" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t"><tspan data-lang-en>Price</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mức giá</tspan></text>
    <text x="220" y="65" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t"><tspan data-lang-en>Cum. Buy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua lũy kế</tspan></text>
    <text x="355" y="65" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t"><tspan data-lang-en>Cum. Sell</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bán lũy kế</tspan></text>
    <text x="490" y="65" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t"><tspan data-lang-en>Possible match</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khớp tối đa</tspan></text>

    <rect x="16" y="84" width="548" height="36" rx="6" class="qfig-row" />
    <text x="86" y="107" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t">25,100</text>
    <text x="220" y="107" text-anchor="middle">3,200</text>
    <text x="355" y="107" text-anchor="middle">4,000</text>
    <text x="490" y="107" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">3,200</text>

    <rect x="16" y="126" width="548" height="36" rx="6" class="qfig-row" />
    <text x="86" y="149" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t">25,000</text>
    <text x="220" y="149" text-anchor="middle">5,500</text>
    <text x="355" y="149" text-anchor="middle">3,800</text>
    <text x="490" y="149" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">3,800</text>

    <rect x="16" y="168" width="548" height="36" rx="6" class="qfig-row" />
    <text x="86" y="191" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t">24,900</text>
    <text x="220" y="191" text-anchor="middle">6,200</text>
    <text x="355" y="191" text-anchor="middle">2,100</text>
    <text x="490" y="191" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">2,100</text>

    <text x="16" y="226" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Includes 1,500 ATC buy shares and 1,200 ATC sell shares inside the cumulative totals.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tổng lũy kế đã bao gồm 1.500 CP mua ATC và 1.200 CP bán ATC.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq03at { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq03at svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq03at text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq03at .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq03at .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq03at .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .qfig-sbq03at .qfig-thbg { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq03at .qfig-row { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.1; }
</style>
